abstract: >-
  A MoonBit-first Single File Component toolchain for building
  luna.mbt-powered UIs with Vue-like authoring, direct DOM-oriented
  client output, and SSR/island delivery. .mbtv components compile to
  raw DOM operations rather than going through a virtual DOM.
keywords:
